8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

Sibling groups can reuse module and function names.
Each group resolves its own function and executes independently.
noteEnd

entry test
group left
function value
push 7
functionEnd int

entry main
module shared
int output
push &output
call value
store

push output
assertEqual 7
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd

group right
function value
push 11
functionEnd int

entry main
module shared
int output
push &output
call value
store

push output
assertEqual 11
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
